### Models

| Model | Properties | Description |
|-------|-----------|-------------|
| User | userId, anonymousHandle, hashedAuth, createdAt, isVerified, karmaScore, postCount, isBanned | Anonymous user account management |
| Post | postId, userId, content, category, imageUrl, createdAt, upvotes, downvotes, commentCount, isReported, isFlagged | User-generated anonymous posts |
| Comment | commentId, postId, userId, content, createdAt, upvotes, downvotes, parentCommentId, isReported | Threaded comment system |
| Vote | voteId, userId, postId, commentId, voteType, createdAt | User voting tracking |
| Report | reportId, reporterId, postId, commentId, reason, status, reviewedAt, moderatorId | Content moderation system |
| Category | categoryId, name, description, iconUrl, postCount, isActive | Topic organization |
| CrisisIntervention | interventionId, userId, postId, triggerType, resourcesProvided, timestamp, followUpRequired | Mental health safety tracking |
| ModerationAction | actionId, moderatorId, targetId, actionType, reason, timestamp | Moderation audit trail |
| SavedPost | savedId, userId, postId, savedAt, notes | User content bookmarking |

### Networking

**Home Feed Screen**
- `(GET)` Fetch trending posts with engagement metrics and real-time updates
- `(GET)` Load user's personalized feed based on interaction history
- `(POST)` Submit upvote/downvote on posts from feed

**Post Creation Screen**
- `(POST)` Create new anonymous post with category and content
- `(POST)` Upload and process anonymous image/video content
- `(GET)` Fetch available categories and posting guidelines

**Post Detail Screen**
- `(GET)` Fetch full post content with threaded comments
- `(POST)` Submit anonymous comment on post
- `(POST)` Report post for community guidelines violation
- `(GET)` Check for crisis intervention triggers and display resources

**Category Browse Screen**
- `(GET)` Fetch posts filtered by specific category
- `(GET)` Load category information and posting statistics
- `(GET)` Retrieve category-specific trending topics

**Search Screen**
- `(GET)` Search posts by keyword with category and date filters
- `(GET)` Fetch search suggestions and popular queries
- `(POST)` Save search queries for future reference

**Safety/Resources Screen**
- `(GET)` Fetch crisis intervention resources and hotline information
- `(GET)` Load mental health professional directory
- `(POST)` Log crisis resource access for follow-up support
- `(GET)` Retrieve community guidelines and safety information

